  "$designPrinciples": [
    "Facts, never prose: the engine emits computed truth; the LLM supplies only sentence-craft.",
    "Traceability is the contract: each renderable number carries an id path so validation is a mechanical lookup, not a judgment call.",
    "The payload pre-computes every comparison the coach is allowed to make (member vs. own history, family vs. own past) and encodes the ones it is forbidden to make (sibling ordering) as constraints, so a well-behaved model cannot drift.",
    "displayOrder is authoritative and non-performance-derived (age ascending). A leaderboard ordering is a validation failure, not a style choice.",
    "The engine — not the model — selects the highlighted moment (published merit heuristic + drought guard). The model is told which one; it never ranks members."
  ],

